---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Home">
  <div class="space-y-16">
    <section class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">Purpose of Human Birth</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 italic">
        A small paragraph explaining that the true purpose of human life is to transcend the physical cycle and achieve the divine path of light.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">Temples & Ashrams</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 italic">
        An explanation of how modern spiritual centers act as beacons for guidance in an increasingly busy and materialistic world.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">Path of Light - A View</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 italic">
        The Path of Light (Olineri) provides the practical steps and wisdom needed to shape one's life toward the ultimate spiritual goal.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>